-| Owning repo has unpushed commits touching the artifact's path, or a dirty worktree over it | `NOT-SAFE` — live work; record and skip |
-| Artifact's last commit is an ancestor of `origin/<default>` | `SAFE(pushed)` — removable after quarantine |
-| Ledger row matches path + hash | `SAFE(moved-to-obsidian)` — source copy removable |
-| Scratch type + zero live references + older than lane's last admitted round | `SAFE(stale)` — removable |
-| Anything else, any doubt, any credential-shaped content | `NOT-SAFE` — stay silent in the dry run |
+| Secret-shaped path component (`*.env`, `.env`, `.env.*`, `.envrc`, `*credential*`, `*secret*`, `id_*`, `*.pem`), before any read | `NOT-SAFE(secrets-refusal)` |
+| Path is `.ufo/state` or `.ufo/watchdog.log`, or lives under `~/.config/**` or driver `scripts/` | `NOT-SAFE`. Do not run the verifiers on these paths (residual R2) |
+| Owning repo has unpushed commits or a dirty worktree over the path | `NOT-SAFE(unpushed)` or `NOT-SAFE(dirty)` |
+| Repo root (a directory containing `.git`) | `SAFE` only via `moved-to-obsidian`; otherwise `NOT-SAFE` with `unpushed=N dirty=M` |
+| Introducing commit is an ancestor of the resolved `refs/remotes/origin/*` ref, and the path exists | `SAFE(pushed)` — removable only after quarantine and a second existence check |
+| No remote-tracking ref | `NOT-SAFE(pushed-unverifiable)`. Never SAFE from `refs/heads/*` |
+| Ledger row matches both hashes, no symlink in either directory digest, source ≠ vault, both paths absolute | `SAFE(moved-to-obsidian)` |
+| Symlink inside a directory digest scope | `NOT-SAFE(symlink-present)` |
+| Worktree registration, named branch, `git log <branch> --not --remotes` non-empty | `NOT-SAFE(unpushed-branch)`, even if the directory is absent or the registration is locked |
+| Worktree registration, directory absent, unique commits = 0, named branch not unpushed | `SAFE(metadata-prune)` — metadata only |
+| Scratch family + hidden-inclusive reference sweep returns 0 + older than `--stale-days` | `SAFE(stale)` |
+| Path missing | `NOT-SAFE(unreachable)`. A deleted path is not a pushed receipt |
+| Anything else, any doubt | `NOT-SAFE` |
 
